{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01X4wdvEPDJ3TcBm4ceNoTnv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## Output Envelope — QuantAgent-3o8 — implementer\n\n**Resultado**: SUCCESS  \n**Run-ID**: 20260510T073737Z-QuantAgent-3o8-implementer  \n**Commit**: `7886ad2b` on `feature/QuantAgent-3o8-implement-replay-execution-mode-reuse-an`\n\n### Files changed\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `quantagent/models.py` | `replay_source_run_id` FK + relationship on `BacktestRun` |\n| `alembic/versions/c9a1b2d3e4f5_…py` | New migration: column + FK + index |\n| `quantagent/backtesting/backtest.py` | `run_replay()`, `_replay_and_trade()`, updated `_create_backtest_run()` / `_calculate_metrics()`, removed duplicate imports |\n| `apps/streamlit/views/replay.py` | Full rewrite: source-run selector, profile multiselect, sequential execution, comparison table |\n\n### Quality gates\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| `git status --short` | PASS |\n| `ruff check --fix` | PASS (9 auto-fixed) |\n| `python -m compileall -q` | PASS |\n| `pytest` | SKIP (no DB/API keys in executor) |\n\n### Key design decisions\n\n- **Signal lookup**: exact `(symbol, generated_at)` map — replay iterates the same date sequence as the source run, guaranteeing hits.\n- **Metric isolation**: `_replay_trade_order_ids` tracks order IDs during replay so `_calculate_metrics()` doesn't mix trades from the source run.\n- **No LLM calls**: `_replay_and_trade()` completely bypasses `strategy.generate_signal()`; only position exit logic (rule-based) still runs.\n\n### Next step\n\n1. `alembic upgrade head` against real DB before merge\n2. Manual QA: run source backtest → Replay tab → multiple profiles → verify distinct P&L\n3. Tester phase for unit tests on `run_replay()`"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":98997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":320},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"471f3e70-3bc2-4389-b48d-0528a3f6a75b","uuid":"d4de85ce-26b3-4e72-a58c-d1f24572ff81"}
